#: funcs.php:164
msgid ""
"The plugin can automatically detect the visitor's country based on their IP "
"address. To enable this, place both SxGeo.php and SxGeo.dat in the GeoIP "
"folder shown below. This folder is outside the plugin, so the files are kept "
"when the plugin is updated."
